# 基础词 Unit11 短语

## 常考短语

- **exceed expectations**: 超出预期 — The results exceeded our expectations. 结果超出了我们的预期。
- **with the exception of**: 除…之外 — Everyone passed with the exception of Tom. 除了汤姆，所有人都通过了。
- **in excess of**: 超过 — The cost was in excess of $10,000. 费用超过了一万美元。
- **exclude from**: 把…排除在外 — He was excluded from the team. 他被排除在团队之外。
- **execute a plan**: 执行计划 — The team executed the plan perfectly. 团队完美执行了计划。
- **exert influence on**: 对…施加影响 — Parents exert great influence on children. 父母对孩子影响很大。
- **exhaust one's patience**: 耗尽耐心 — His complaints exhausted my patience. 他的抱怨耗尽了我的耐心。
- **on exhibit**: 在展出 — Several works are on exhibit. 几件作品在展出。
- **expand one's horizons**: 开阔视野 — Travel helps expand your horizons. 旅行有助于开阔视野。
- **at the expense of**: 以…为代价 — He gained wealth at the expense of health. 他以健康为代价获得了财富。
- **exploit resources**: 开发资源 — We should not overexploit resources. 我们不应过度开发资源。
- **explore the possibility**: 探索可能性 — We should explore the possibility of cooperation. 我们应探索合作的可能性。
- **be exposed to**: 接触到 — Children are exposed to many influences. 孩子们接触到很多影响。
- **extend an invitation**: 发出邀请 — We extended an invitation to all. 我们向所有人发出了邀请。
- **to a great extent**: 在很大程度上 — Success depends on effort to a great extent. 成功在很大程度上取决于努力。
- **extreme weather**: 极端天气 — The region experiences extreme weather. 该地区经历极端天气。
- **a failure to do**: 未能做 — His failure to attend was noticed. 他未能出席被注意到了。
- **have faith in**: 对…有信心 — She has faith in her team. 她对团队有信心。
- **be fascinated by**: 被…迷住 — She was fascinated by the history. 她被历史迷住了。
- **a fatal mistake**: 致命错误 — Ignoring the warning was a fatal mistake. 忽视警告是致命错误。

